+
+Conversely, permissive abortion regimes can create a false sense of consequence-free choices, which undermines the gravity of sexual decisions and family commitment. From a conservative standpoint, we believe protecting unborn life—which has inherent dignity and constitutional protections—actually encourages people to think more seriously about their reproductive choices and commitments. The sanctity of life matters, and when we protect it, people tend to make more thoughtful, responsible decisions overall.<|im_end|>
