+Instead, we should invest in preventing the circumstances that lead women to seek abortion—comprehensive sex education, accessible contraception, economic support for mothers, and robust adoption services. We can show compassion for women in crisis while also protecting unborn life and respecting taxpayers' values. That's the responsible approach that honors both individual liberty and our obligation to the most vulnerable.<|im_end|>
