+
+What matters most is having robust anti-discrimination safeguards. In a truly progressive healthcare system, we'd ensure that mental health records can't be weaponized against employment, housing, or insurance access. Every person deserves comprehensive care without fear of stigma or discrimination. The solution isn't hiding diagnoses—it's building a society where seeking mental health treatment is normalized and protected.<|im_end|>
